        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents A07-K5200S-US3, Polished Brass Doctors Door Knocker</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Polished Brass Traditional Doctors Door Knocker is ideal for adding elegance to any front door. At 5-3/4\" high, this is the smaller version of the always popular Doctor's Door Knocker. Made by Brass Accents, it is hand finished in the USA. This brass door knocker is made with the distinctive craftsmanship and old-world tradition for which Brass Accents is known. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here for the larger <a href=\"/products/8-inch-traditional-doctors-door-knocker-brass-accents-a07-k5210\">8 inch High Doctors Door Knocker</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 5-3/4\" Doctor's Door Knocker:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Polished Brass</b></li>\r\n<li>Height: 5-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Round Mount & Knocker Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Materiel: Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>\r\n** This item is discontinued. See available <a href=\"/collections/knockers\">Door Knockers</a>. \r\n</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<!-- <p>\r\n<b>** Clearance Priced,  limited quantities available. \r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>Only One Left</b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p> -->",
